01.steps:
steps:
1. Configure Site to Site TI VPN between Gen 6 devices, say central FW and remote FW;
2. Enable the checkbox of "Enable DNS Proxy" and "Enforce DNS Proxy For All DNS Requests"at central FW and remote FW;
3. Setup a DNS Server at central FW to be reachable over the WAN interfaces X3; 4. Configure Split DNS for DNS Domain *.sonicwall.com on central FW and remote FW, primary DNS server is the DNS server reachable via interface X3;
5. Send DNS traffic for domain *.sonicwall.com from X0 on central FW and remote FW;
6. Check split DNS server status on both central FW and remote FW;

034.steps:
1. add a split DNS entry with wildcard e.g., *.sonicwall.com;
2. Query for www.sonicwall.com;
3. Query for sonicwall.com;

034.result:
in step 1, entry is added successfully;
in step 2, query was going to the specified server;
in step 3, query was going to the specified server.
